{"v":4,"catch":"在挑戰中滑行、長大、解鎖令人興奮的世界！","desc":"Snaky Snakes 是一款令人興奮的遊戲，玩家要控制一條蛇通過隨機產生的障礙，同時收集櫻桃。每顆櫻桃都會增加蛇的長度和得分。此外，玩家可以使用櫻桃從遊戲中的商店購買新的環境，例如沙漠、亞洲和舞廳。遊戲的目標是取得最高分數並解鎖所有環境。","publisher":"Zakym","release":"2024-11-14","genres":["街機","模擬","益智","訓練"],"players":"單機 1 人","langs":["英文"],"pmax":1,"poff":1,"rating":"NONE","size":"Switch 2 0.1GB / Switch 0.1GB","modes":["TV 模式","桌上模式","手提模式"],"shots":["https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/5b0a2562fa9b782bd0b39baafb85d54a73054d7c691f1f5ed5934b4e76dd4bee.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/fe4c0ad2e2d7f7270aa0acd39815d411c212a369af5c745112b732553a1c0ebc.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/80e5a1f6204d2d91a4c16b21f3c83a412d9cbfe57fe878b8094360ff71226b9c.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/74374d345642f4e92ad30ad750c560b9d05b93ea17b3ba9ac7aa4cad9d090beb.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/a01b20dcfd4bf60a7d641d55820c486849de6aee1b7cad293908bc72c58c6da0.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/e3417d65184051a27b13bb0cbc30b4f2bae3aaf98c663e452280ade3fe3de671.jpg"],"titleId":"0100d2c020b10000","dlc":[]}